    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλόξεν-ος</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλοξέν-ξεινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loving strangers, hospitable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.576
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
