				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παθεῖν φιλόξενον
			ἔργον</span> to meet with an act <i>of hospitality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				2.24
			</span></i>; 
